devterm-windows
Adaptação para Windows (Windows Terminal + WSL2) do devterm, de skaisser:
https://github.com/skaisser/devterm — licença Apache 2.0.
Os arquivos assets/skaisser.omp.json, assets/statusline.sh, assets/zshrc.local.example
e a base de assets/zshrc.wsl vêm do devterm. As cores (assets/skaisser.wt-scheme.json)
foram convertidas de assets/skaisser.itermcolors do devterm.
